US Representative Green: Whoah!

250
00:20:34,080 --> 00:20:34,920
Ritsuko: That must be,

251
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:37,280
Misato: Eva's true form.

252
00:20:45,880 --> 00:20:46,920
Makoto: Circuits reconnected.

253
00:20:46,990 --> 00:20:47,600
