259
00:20:55,220 --> 00:20:55,220
Shinji: Huh? Huh? Uh. Uhuh! Oh. Ohh. Huh. AHH!

260
00:21:36,940 --> 00:21:39,220
Misato: Shinji, can I come in?

261
00:21:42,880 --> 00:21:44,480
Misato: I forgot to tell you something.

262
00:21:46,040 --> 00:21:49,000
Misato: You did something *very* good and *very* noble today.

263
00:21:49,780 --> 00:21:51,080
Misato: You should, be proud.

264
00:21:52,160 --> 00:21:53,080
Misato: Good night, Shinji.

265
00:21:56,000 --> 00:21:56,600
Misato: Hang in there.

266
00:22:00,900 --> 00:22:07,300
Claire Littley: Claire Littley: Fly me to the moon and let me play among the stars

267
00:22:09,180 --> 00:22:15,680
Claire Littley: Let me see what spring is like on Jupiter and Mars

268
00:22:16,760 --> 00:22:22,260
Claire Littley: In other words, hold my hand

