00:22:36,260 --> 00:22:39,840
Claire Littley: And let me sing forevermore

272
00:22:41,660 --> 00:22:44,400
Claire Littley: You are all I long for

273
00:22:44,780 --> 00:22:47,600
Claire Littley: All I worship and adore

274
00:22:49,300 --> 00:22:52,160
Claire Littley: In other words

